		-- {32111, 32112, 32113, 32114}
		introduction_th = 'หนึ่งใน "สามแหวน" ของหมู่บ้านใบไม้ซ่อนเร้น ศิษย์ของ Sarutobi Hiruzen อาจารย์ของ Namikaze Minato, Nagato, Yahiko, Konan และ Uzumaki Naruto เขาคือคนที่ Naruto เคารพมากที่สุดในชีวิต เขาช่วยแนะนำ Naruto ในการฝึกฝนและมีบทบาทสำคัญในเส้นทางการเติบโตของเขา หลังจากนั้นเขาก็ไปที่หมู่บ้านฝนเพื่อสืบข่าว แต่โชคร้ายถูกฆ่าตายโดยผู้นำของ Akatsuki - Pain',
		introduction = 'One of the "Three Rings" of the Village Hidden in the Leaves, a student of Sarutobi Hiruzen, teacher of Namikaze Minato, Nagato, Yahiko, Konan, and Uzumaki Naruto. He was the person Naruto respected most in life, guided him in training, and played an important role in Naruto\'s growth. Later, he went to the Hidden Rain village for reconnaissance but tragically died at the hands of Akatsuki\'s leader – Pain.',
		introduction_vn = 'Một trong "Tam Nhẫn" của Làng Lá, học trò của Sarutobi Hiruzen, thầy của Namikaze Minato, Nagato, Yahiko, Konan và Uzumaki Naruto. Ông là người Naruto kính trọng nhất trong đời, đã hướng dẫn Naruto tu luyện và đóng vai trò quan trọng trên con đường trưởng thành của cậu. Sau đó, ông đến làng Mưa để do thám thông tin nhưng không may tử nạn dưới tay thủ lĩnh Akatsuki – Pain.',
		introduction_in = 'Salah satu dari "Tiga Cincin" di Desa Daun Tersembunyi, murid Sarutobi Hiruzen, guru dari Namikaze Minato, Nagato, Yahiko, Konan, dan Uzumaki Naruto. Dia adalah orang yang paling dihormati Naruto dalam hidupnya, membimbingnya dalam pelatihan dan memainkan peran penting dalam pertumbuhannya. Setelah itu, dia pergi ke Desa Hujan untuk melakukan penyelidikan tetapi sayangnya meninggal di tangan pemimpin Akatsuki – Pain.',
		introduction_en = 'One of the "Three Rings" of the Village Hidden in the Leaves, a student of Sarutobi Hiruzen, teacher of Namikaze Minato, Nagato, Yahiko, Konan, and Uzumaki Naruto. He was the person Naruto respected most in life, guided him in training, and played an important role in Naruto\'s growth. Later, he went to the Hidden Rain village for reconnaissance but tragically died at the hands of Akatsuki\'s leader – Pain.',
